      "headline": "After deadly Kyiv strike, Ukraine warns interceptor shortage is costing lives",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "After deadly Kyiv strike, Ukraine warns interceptor shortage is costing lives - Published At the Kvitneva railway station near Kyiv, workers lift white body bags from the pockmarked platform and carry them to waiting ambulances.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478734+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "After deadly Kyiv strike, Ukraine warns interceptor shortage is costing lives - Published At the Kvitneva railway station near Kyiv, workers lift white body bags from the pockmarked platform and carry them to waiting ambulances.",
          "sentence_hash": "852b38d691e6cafbdd03e148a02ba80c81dafb49cdb396aada0c439a5bd45c46",
          "anchors": [
            "she",
            "for"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Shoes, glasses and some pieces of clothing mark the spot where eight people were killed during Russia's latest massive aerial attack on Ukraine.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478794+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "Shoes, glasses and some pieces of clothing mark the spot where eight people were killed during Russia's latest massive aerial attack on Ukraine.",
          "sentence_hash": "1ac458e689c8e252aad5f187597d1f00b0410ba21dbdde7a9c4dd95dcce65c43",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Overnight, Moscow fired 115 drones and 24 ballistic missiles.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478815+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "Overnight, Moscow fired 115 drones and 24 ballistic missiles.",
          "sentence_hash": "4e8ca833233257ef4ac93a37c45f29ed9e0e988e4005861caa2068048c224538",
          "anchors": [
            "ballistic"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Most of the drones were shot down, but Kyiv's depleted air defences did not intercept any of the missiles.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478840+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "Most of the drones were shot down, but Kyiv's depleted air defences did not intercept any of the missiles.",
          "sentence_hash": "ee53f25a2526d2471813de14bd6fe01cdc73dd24a548ef5509acad5e3ffdab32",
          "anchors": [
            "down",
            "but"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The latest Russian barrage destroyed storage and logistics facilities - from online retailer warehouses to a postal sorting centre.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478869+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "The latest Russian barrage destroyed storage and logistics facilities - from online retailer warehouses to a postal sorting centre.",
          "sentence_hash": "f180dde3d3fbd676784d4ec5d98b777fc1373ed4819c667ee898404e18a44c25",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "In Kvitneva, it is not clear if the target was the railway itself or the warehouse beside it, which was also hit and was still smouldering hours later.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-06T08:03:35.478897+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "8a4c47fe97757ab8249d2860c1e40ff33d032b9d1131e662886626f5bf2c8253",
          "excerpt": "In Kvitneva, it is not clear if the target was the railway itself or the warehouse beside it, which was also hit and was still smouldering hours later.",
          "sentence_hash": "f84812703be86b97533df547e46b75845dc59ded043626a7d588a4c1ea0f391f",
